# Ignore per-user Claude Code state but commit shared skills + commands.
# Pattern uses wildcard + negation: gitignore can't un-ignore inside a
# fully-ignored directory, so we ignore CONTENTS of .claude (with /*)
# then re-include the skills + commands subtrees.
#   skills/   = .claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md  (model-invocable + slash command)
#   commands/ = .claude/commands/<name>.md      (slash command, simpler form)
# Both register as `/name` slash commands in Claude Code. Two entry
# points → resilience: if Claude Code's skill-discovery misses a project
# subdir (per-version regressions seen 2026-05-28), the explicit
# commands/ file still surfaces the slash command.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/commands/**
coverage/
# Onboarding paczki dla nowych devów — mogą zawierać klucze .env w plain text.
# Trzymaj poza repo, przekaż osobnym kanałem (Signal / 1Password / GPG).
*-env-package.zip
*-env-package/
# project 3 (Primundus calculator, Next.js) co-locates here so we can ship
# it alongside the CA app from a single Render Blueprint. Its own
# project 3/.gitignore keeps node_modules / .env / .next out of the repo.
